<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
  <title>KAIZEN — Terms of Service</title>
</head>
<body class="app-page">
  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>
  <main class="app-main" style="max-width:800px;">
    <div class="page-header">
      <div>
        <h1 style="color:var(--gold);">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="page-sub">Last updated: May 2025</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:28px;">
      <div>
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:10px;">1. Acceptance of Terms</h3>
        <p style="font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.85;">
          By creating a KAIZEN account you agree to these terms. KAIZEN is a
          behavioral accountability and journaling platform. It is not a
          financial advisory service and does not provide investment advice,
          trading signals, or recommendations to buy or sell any financial instrument.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:24px;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:10px;">2. Not Financial Advice</h3>
        <p style="font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.85;">
          All content on KAIZEN including Discipline Scores, AI feedback, journal
          analysis, and ZA bounty information is for educational and behavioral
          tracking purposes only. Trading financial markets involves substantial
          risk. You are solely responsible for your trading decisions.
          KAIZEN is not liable for any financial losses incurred.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:24px;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:10px;">3. Account Responsibilities</h3>
        <p style="font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.85;">
          You are responsible for maintaining the security of your account
          credentials. You must not share your account with others or use
          the platform for any illegal purpose. KAIZEN reserves the right to
          suspend accounts that violate these terms.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:24px;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:10px;">4. Intellectual Property</h3>
        <p style="font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.85;">
          The KAIZEN brand, logo, design, and platform are proprietary.
          Your journal entries and trading data remain yours. By using the
          platform you grant KAIZEN a limited license to process your data
          to provide the service described in our Privacy Policy.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:24px;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:10px;">5. Changes to Terms</h3>
        <p style="font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.85;">
          KAIZEN reserves the right to update these terms at any time.
          Continued use of the platform after changes constitutes acceptance
          of the new terms. Major changes will be communicated via email.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <script src="/js/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
